      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a modern-day urban RPG set in a big western city. i need some quick, standard NPC templates to flesh out the world. can you give me short descriptions for these archetypes?\n\n1. a successful CEO\n2. a suspicious person hanging out in a dark alley\n3. a friendly neighbor\n4. a high-ranking police officer",
